{
  "comment": "Fixed conversion examples, worked by hand. The server's rule (services/currencyConversion.ts) and the client's copy of it (client/src/utils/balanceConversion.ts) are both tested against this file, so they cannot drift apart. Amounts are integer cents; rates are pesos per dollar.",
  "rates": [
    { "date": "2026-03-04", "rate": 42.5 },
    { "date": "2026-03-02", "rate": 40 },
    { "date": "2026-03-09", "rate": 39.123 }
